# Differences between the GUI lock and nv-rs's lock for the crates the engine's facade and play entry reach, accepted
# by hand (tools/check-component-locks). One per line: name, the GUI versions, the nv-rs versions. Each lock resolves
# on its own, so some difference is normal; the engine CI job builds and tests against the GUI lock's versions.
# Remove a line when the difference goes away (the check fails on a line that no longer applies).
#
# A later patch or minor release of the same line, picked by the GUI's own dependencies or a later resolution:
bumpalo 3.20.4 3.20.3
errno 0.3.15 0.3.14
itoa 1.0.19 1.0.18
js-sys 0.3.107 0.3.106
tokio 1.54.1 1.53.1
unicode-ident 1.0.27 1.0.26
wasm-bindgen 0.2.130 0.2.129
wasm-bindgen-futures 0.4.80 0.4.79
wasm-bindgen-macro 0.2.130 0.2.129
wasm-bindgen-macro-support 0.2.130 0.2.129
wasm-bindgen-shared 0.2.130 0.2.129
web-sys 0.3.107 0.3.106
#
# Another release line, each lock keeping the one its own resolution chose (cc is the C compiler driver, used while
# building only; the GUI lock cannot move it to nv-rs's 1.11.1 because a dependency in its tree requires cc below 1.9, as
# `cargo update -p cc --precise 1.11.1` reports):
cc 1.8.0 1.11.1
ordered-float 5.5.1 4.6.0
unicode-width 0.2.3 0.1.14
